ns 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, August to September came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years, the most of any pair. In 2025 the middle went from 179% of normal in May to June down to 38% in November to December. Grid 21807 had its driest year in 1963 at 66% of normal.</p>"}
